168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 122 0 R
/E (My name is Matthew Kim, and I am honored to serve as one of your Co-Directors this year at LakeMUN 2026! I am joined by my fellow dais members: the nifty, noble Natalie Gan and the vivacious, valiant Vivian Hong. The three of us are ecstatic to be a part of your Model United Nations journey, whether LakeMUN is your first conference or one of your last!)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
