171 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 122 0 R
/E (There is no body of elected representatives to hold you accountable, no Supreme Court to check you, no standing constitution to restrain you, and no higher power to protect Panem from your decisions. Whether Panem remains an unstable federation, fractures into civil war, descends into authoritarianism, or dares to construct a true democracy will be decided by your actions alone.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 122 0 R
/E (What you choose to do with your respective districts and agencies is entirely at your discretion. Your president has assigned the responsibility of managing the affairs of the entire nation to you and your fellow ministers. As a legislative body, you may choose to draft a new federal constitution, create laws, respond to crises, and establish new ministries and agencies as the body sees fit.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
