176 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (This committee is designed as a full-scale political and crisis simulation. Those holding executive power will simultaneously participate in legislative debate and also control their respective districts, ministries, and military forces. President Paylor has entrusted you with drafting laws, restructuring institutions, confronting unrest and violence, negotiating with rebels and loyalists, and ultimately, shaping the identity of a new Panem. Every directive and bill you pass will have consequences that ripple across the simulation. There is no preset ending.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
