>>
endobj
178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (Given the lack of information in the novels surrounding the rebuilding of Panem between the Second Rebellion and the end of the series, we have taken some creative liberties in order to build the world that this committee takes place in. Information on Panem, the state of the nation, its districts, institutions, and more is located later in this guide. This committee, and the world that surrounds it, has been designed from the ground up to reward those who think boldly, take risks, and most critically, collaborate with their fellow Congress members.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
