/E (In the aftermath of the Second Rebellion, Panem currently faces the challenge of rebuilding a nation without the centralized authority that once governed it. As the first permanent national governing body of millions, the Panem Congress is tasked with reconstructing political, economic, and security structures in a deeply fragmented and unstable society.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
