/E (District 8 is in charge of textile and clothing production. In the past, most citizens worked extremely long and grueling days in large factories and sewing plants with hardly any pay. They were one of the first districts to rebel, and their strong resentment comes from their poor treatment despite the importance of their outputs. Above all, District 8 is tired of their working conditions and demand reform and regulations to protect such a situation from ever occurring again. On top of this, as District 8 was one of the first districts to rebel against Snow, they push for laws that will give Panem citizens more autonomy and power.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [9]
>>
