/E (District 13 is heavily involved in nuclear technology and other forms of high-tech military production. Highly specialized in war and defense, they step out of the shadows to join this Congress and do one thing: provide a warning. For years, they have watched the Capitol destroy the lives of ordinary citizens for their own well-being, and now harbor extreme hatred for centralized regimes. They will do anything in their power to prevent any other district from being too powerful; ironically, potentially placing themselves in the highest position of power if a compromise is not worked out.)
